cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the derived data, please cite both the paper (preferred-citation) and this archived release."
title: "Replication code and derived data for 'Rainfall Index Insurance Under Exceptional Drought: Payout Alignment and Producer Response'"
abstract: >-
  Replication code and derived data for a study benchmarking payouts from the
  USDA Pasture, Rangeland, and Forage (PRF) Rainfall Index insurance program
  against U.S. Drought Monitor exceptional (D4) drought across nine western
  U.S. states, 2010-2025, and modeling how prior-year drought and basis-risk
  experience relate to subsequent PRF enrollment.
type: software
